  "prefLabel": "Ins 2702.02 Scope and Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2702.02 Scope and Applicability. The requirements of this part shall apply to all health insurance issuers offering health insurance coverage in connection with a group health insurance plan that provides coverage to a group employer.\n\nSource. #9809, eff 11-8-10; ss by #12685, eff 12-3-18",
